{{!
    @template format_dari/chatbox

    Ask Dari panel. Rendered once per page inside the hero banner and hidden until the AI
    Tutor button in the hero is pressed.

    3.2.0: the panel has two views, switched by data-view on the root.
    * compact  - the floating panel (a bottom sheet on phones).
    * expanded - the Study view: a large centred workspace over a backdrop (full screen on phones)
                 with a rail holding the learner's context and the study tools, and a wider,
                 card-based conversation column.
    Both views are the same DOM; only CSS changes, so nothing is re-rendered and the conversation,
    focus and scroll position survive the switch.

    It is an ARIA dialog: role="dialog", aria-labelledby pointing at its own title, and aria-modal
    "false" in the compact view (it sits beside the page) or "true" in the Study view, which covers
    the page and traps Tab. The JavaScript keeps aria-modal in step with data-view. The message list is a role="log" aria-live="polite" region so replies, errors and the
    "Thinking…" state are announced, and it carries dir="auto" so a reply in a different script
    keeps its base direction. Opening, closing, the Tab focus trap, Escape and focus restoration
    are provided by format_dari/chatbox. Every SVG in here is decorative and therefore carries
    aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"; every icon-only button has an aria-label.

    Classes required for JS:
    * dari-ai-chatbox - the panel root; shown/hidden by format_dari/chatbox.
    * dari-ai-backdrop - the Study view backdrop; clicking it returns to the compact view.
    * dari-ai-chatbox-close - closes the panel.
    * dari-ai-expand - switches between the compact and Study views.
    * dari-ai-newchat - clears the conversation.
    * dari-ai-quick-btn - sends the canned prompt named by data-prompt.
    * dari-ai-send-btn - sends the current textarea contents.
    * dari-ai-message, dari-ai-message-bot, dari-ai-message-content - matched by
      format_dari/chatbox when it updates the welcome message.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-view - on the panel root, compact or expanded.
    * data-prompt - on each quick action button, the key of the canned prompt to send. One of
      concepts, practice, workplace (structure and checklist prompts remain available to JS).

    Element ids required for JS:
    * dari-ai-chatbox, dari-ai-backdrop, dari-ai-close, dari-ai-messages,
      dari-ai-welcome, dari-ai-quick-actions, dari-ai-suggest, dari-ai-input,
      dari-ai-send.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * closelabel string Accessible name of the close button.
    * inputlabel string Visually hidden label of the question textarea.
    * placeholder string Placeholder of the question textarea.
    * sendlabel string Accessible name and tooltip of the send button.
    * welcome string PRE-ESCAPED greeting. It is the aiassistant_welcome_name /
      aiassistant_welcome_section / aiassistant_welcome_activity language string, which
      legitimately contains <strong>, resolved with $a values that have already been through
      format_string(). It is therefore rendered with a triple mustache.
    * coursename string The course's name, already through format_string().
    * contextkind string "Activity", "Section" or "Course".
    * contexttitle string Name of the activity or section being studied, or the course name.
    * tools array The five study tools: key, label, desc and one is<key> icon flag each.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "closelabel": "Close",
        "inputlabel": "Your question for Ask Dari",
        "placeholder": "Ask a question about the course...",
        "sendlabel": "Send message",
        "welcome": "Hi Sam! I see you're working on <strong>Week 1 quiz</strong>. What would you like help with?",
        "coursename": "Work Health and Safety",
        "contextkind": "Activity",
        "contexttitle": "Week 1 quiz",
        "tools": [
            {"key": "practice", "label": "Practice questions", "desc": "Test yourself", "ispractice": true}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="dari-ai-backdrop" id="dari-ai-backdrop" hidden></div>
<div id="dari-ai-chatbox" class="dari-ai-chatbox" style="display:none;" data-view="compact" role="dialog" aria-modal="false" aria-labelledby="dari-ai-chatbox-title">
<div class="dari-ai-chatbox-header">
<div class="dari-ai-chatbox-heading">
<span class="dari-ai-avatar dari-ai-avatar-head" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20"><path d="M10.5 3.5c.5 4.1 2.9 6.5 7 7-4.1.5-6.5 2.9-7 7-.5-4.1-2.9-6.5-7-7 4.1-.5 6.5-2.9 7-7z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><path d="M18.25 14.25c.2 1.6.9 2.3 2.5 2.5-1.6.2-2.3.9-2.5 2.5-.2-1.6-.9-2.3-2.5-2.5 1.6-.2 2.3-.9 2.5-2.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" fill-opacity=".6"/></svg></span>
<div class="dari-ai-chatbox-titles">
<div class="dari-ai-chatbox-title" id="dari-ai-chatbox-title">{{#str}} aiassistant, format_dari {{/str}}</div>
{{#contexttitle}}<div class="dari-ai-chatbox-subtitle" dir="auto">{{contexttitle}}</div>{{/contexttitle}}
</div>
</div>
<div class="dari-ai-chatbox-actions">
<button type="button" class="dari-ai-headbtn dari-ai-newchat" aria-label="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_newchat, format_dari {{/cleanstr}}" title="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_newchat, format_dari {{/cleanstr}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18"><path d="M5.25 4.25h13.5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8.75a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H11.5l-4.75 3.5v-3.5h-1.5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6.25a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity=".16"/><path d="M12 7.75v5.5M9.25 10.5h5.5"/></svg></button>
<button type="button" class="dari-ai-headbtn dari-ai-expand" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_expand, format_dari {{/cleanstr}}" title="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_expand, format_dari {{/cleanstr}}" data-expandlabel="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_expand, format_dari {{/cleanstr}}" data-collapselabel="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_collapse, format_dari {{/cleanstr}}"><svg class="dari-ai-icon-expand" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18"><path d="M4.75 9.25v-4.5h4.5M14.75 4.75h4.5v4.5M19.25 14.75v4.5h-4.5M9.25 19.25h-4.5v-4.5"/></svg><svg class="dari-ai-icon-collapse" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18"><path d="M9.25 4.75v4.5h-4.5M19.25 9.25h-4.5v-4.5M14.75 19.25v-4.5h4.5M4.75 14.75h4.5v4.5"/></svg><span class="dari-ai-headbtn-text">{{#str}} aiassistant_studyview, format_dari {{/str}}</span></button>
<button type="button" class="dari-ai-chatbox-close" id="dari-ai-close" aria-label="{{closelabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18"><path d="M6.75 6.75l10.5 10.5M17.25 6.75 6.75 17.25" stroke-width="1.75"/></svg></button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="dari-ai-chatbox-body">
<aside class="dari-ai-rail" aria-label="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_tools_heading, format_dari {{/cleanstr}}">
<div class="dari-ai-rail-section">
<div class="dari-ai-rail-label">{{#str}} aiassistant_context_heading, format_dari {{/str}}</div>
<div class="dari-ai-context-card">
<span class="dari-ai-context-kind">{{contextkind}}</span>
<span class="dari-ai-context-title" dir="auto">{{contexttitle}}</span>
{{#coursename}}<span class="dari-ai-context-course" dir="auto">{{coursename}}</span>{{/coursename}}
</div>
</div>
<div class="dari-ai-rail-section">
<div class="dari-ai-rail-label">{{#str}} aiassistant_tools_heading, format_dari {{/str}}</div>
<div class="dari-ai-rail-tools">
{{#tools}}
<button type="button" class="dari-ai-quick-btn dari-ai-tool dari-ai-tool-rail" data-prompt="{{key}}"><span class="dari-ai-tool-icon">{{> format_dari/chatbox_icon }}</span><span class="dari-ai-tool-text"><span class="dari-ai-tool-label">{{label}}</span><span class="dari-ai-tool-desc">{{desc}}</span></span></button>
{{/tools}}
</div>
</div>
<div class="dari-ai-rail-foot">{{#str}} aiassistant_integrity_note, format_dari {{/str}}</div>
</aside>
<div class="dari-ai-main">
<div class="dari-ai-chatbox-messages" id="dari-ai-messages" role="log" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions" dir="auto">
<div class="dari-ai-message dari-ai-message-bot dari-ai-message-welcome" id="dari-ai-welcome">
<span class="dari-ai-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round" width="16" height="16"><path d="M10.5 3.5c.5 4.1 2.9 6.5 7 7-4.1.5-6.5 2.9-7 7-.5-4.1-2.9-6.5-7-7 4.1-.5 6.5-2.9 7-7z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><path d="M18.25 14.25c.2 1.6.9 2.3 2.5 2.5-1.6.2-2.3.9-2.5 2.5-.2-1.6-.9-2.3-2.5-2.5 1.6-.2 2.3-.9 2.5-2.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" fill-opacity=".6"/></svg></span>
<div class="dari-ai-message-body"><div class="dari-ai-message-content">{{{welcome}}}</div></div>
</div>
<div class="dari-ai-quick-actions" id="dari-ai-quick-actions">
<div class="dari-ai-quick-label">{{#str}} aiassistant_quick_label, format_dari {{/str}}</div>
<div class="dari-ai-quick-buttons">
{{#tools}}
<button type="button" class="dari-ai-quick-btn dari-ai-tool dari-ai-tool-card" data-prompt="{{key}}"><span class="dari-ai-tool-icon">{{> format_dari/chatbox_icon }}</span><span class="dari-ai-tool-text"><span class="dari-ai-tool-label">{{label}}</span><span class="dari-ai-tool-desc">{{desc}}</span></span></button>
{{/tools}}
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="dari-ai-suggest" id="dari-ai-suggest" hidden>
{{#tools}}
<button type="button" class="dari-ai-quick-btn dari-ai-chip" data-prompt="{{key}}">{{> format_dari/chatbox_icon }}<span>{{label}}</span></button>
{{/tools}}
</div>
<div class="dari-ai-chatbox-input">
<div class="dari-ai-composer">
<label class="accesshide" for="dari-ai-input">{{inputlabel}}</label>
<textarea id="dari-ai-input" dir="auto" rows="1" placeholder="{{placeholder}}"></textarea>
<button type="button" id="dari-ai-send" class="dari-ai-send-btn" aria-label="{{sendlabel}}" title="{{sendlabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18"><path d="M20.25 3.75 3.75 10.5l6.75 3 3 6.75z" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity=".16"/><path d="M20.25 3.75 10.5 13.5"/></svg></button>
</div>
<div class="dari-ai-composer-hint" aria-hidden="true">{{#str}} aiassistant_composer_hint, format_dari {{/str}}</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
